{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120183837583-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120185546\"/><p>啟德體育園近期舉行盛事。</p><p>本月13日至19日，相關部門在全港多區展開反非法勞工行動。而在13至15日及17日，啟德體育園舉行盛事期間，多個部門在附近採取聯合行動，打擊非法勞工、流動小販售賣侵權物品及非法兜售演唱會門票活動等。行動中，人員拘捕1男4女懷疑非法勞工(21至31歲)。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.053652+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:38:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T12:37:17.310946+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:19.856489+00:00","content_hash":"fd99f0135a455615e32d21cbc12f70ee87a6dafe656b56cb0d87e145efdd5656","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}